OL,3,GNEWSAMusic event aims to unite dads and
OL,4,ASEND children
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn event hosted by a not-for-profit
OL,7,Fcompany for fathers of neurodivergent
OL,8,Fchildren aims to "bring everyone
OL,9,Ftogether under music".
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire-based SENDS 4 Dad CIC
OL,12,Fis a support network for fathers or
OL,13,Fmale carers of children or adults with
OL,14,Fspecial educational needs and
OL,15,Fdisabilities (SEND).
OL,17,FThe family-friendly music event,
OL,18,FDadstock, is at The Black Prince in
OL,19,FNorthampton later.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
