OL,3,GNEWSAMusic event aims to unite dads and
OL,4,ASEND children
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Meadows, chief executive of the
OL,7,Forganisation, said: "Music connects all
OL,8,Fof us, no matter your background.
OL,9,FEspecially if you're neurodiverse...
OL,10,Fmusic is a massive, massive thing."
